{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_6001_p", "source_sha256": "93077a26a36c0011399905a65b434f4ba00350fe187683b97e347833acc49629", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』のロケ。\nもうすぐ撮影が始まるけど、歩の様子はどうかな？）", "zh": "（今天是写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的外景拍摄。马上就要开始拍摄了，步现在状态怎么样呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_6002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4f32eae90b580478fffc820f86d66566f5896c61f1c3d25135772e29b48c4df0", "ja": "うーん……ヒョウかぁ……。", "zh": "嗯……美洲豹啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_6003_p", "source_sha256": "003cc528594d56fc2d977f4f171cd5e3c36cd6ebff7fc64db1a2133d21126cf1", "ja": "お疲れさま、歩。なんだか浮かない顔をしてるけど、\n何か気になるところでもあったか？", "zh": "辛苦了，步。你好像有点闷闷不乐的，是有什么在意的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_6004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4867eb209f9cf5b7a2a3ef44fc9d1adbc2a9778b8804ea3d7447a8767c875399", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。\nそれが……ロケのことで、ちょっとね。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n是这样……关于外景拍摄，有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_6005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1815ecb1fe98d056e872cb04a5f56b3288e9b9942dc224a63a91e47133d703d9", "ja": "この衣装だし、いつも通りじゃ格好つかない気がして。\nでも、どんな感じにすればいいかわかんなくてさ……。", "zh": "这套服装的话，感觉要是像平时那样就不太合适。  \n可是，我也不知道该弄成什么感觉才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_6006_p", "source_sha256": "ded6203608d5e20a47ad1eb25a5e060f6268268e5cb91bdd35c0d8cdb156ebdb", "ja": "なるほど……。\nロケの方向性で悩んでるってことか。", "zh": "原来如此……\n也就是说，你是在为外景拍摄的方向而烦恼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_6007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b85a107a5abf2a7b4968714ad7478c315a21b6d1160b926c877cf5dda573084c", "ja": "そうそう、方向性！　ヒョウの衣装だから、\nヒョウっぽい感じが出た方がいいんだろうけど……。", "zh": "对对，就是方向性！因为穿的是豹纹服装，所以最好能展现出豹的感觉吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_6008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "94381fb088bc2203e7b5934196a0ad1da12e92c3c92542025f8562f7f156fe2e", "ja": "アタシ、ヒョウのことに詳しくないからさ。\nねえ{$P$}、どうすればいいと思う？", "zh": "我对豹不太了解嘛。\n你觉得该怎么做，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_6009", "source_sha256": "a9dd7101b3b1c27010117396d0334cb88c7e432f925cd77b6089e6c5c203e433", "ja": "ワイルドに！", "zh": "野性狂野！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_6010", "source_sha256": "7852c6f63381542c6891ab5f8ec7db5f6487e075475324f56c6e4e1f90796005", "ja": "セクシーに！", "zh": "性感一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_6011", "source_sha256": "d4266c3c649790f93b6313f8037c58f635cf00f6ddbbff619da3d6e702759845", "ja": "ヒョウヒョウと！", "zh": "潇洒地！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_6100_p", "source_sha256": "6567638d1f166cfcb94ecbad10945b4e36a926889a90b515df43fdde3b0a601f", "ja": "獲物を狩るヒョウみたいに、ワイルドな感じで\nいくのはどうだ？　かっこいい写真になると思うぞ。", "zh": "像捕猎猎物的豹子一样，走野性风怎么样？我觉得这样拍出来的照片会很帅。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_6101_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1d2fa93b4175e106ed20fe666743058e9facd9deb4f243020df9a3dc6a4e2904", "ja": "ワイルドか……。確かに、自然がいっぱいだし、\nカッコいいポーズをキメたら、迫力が出るかも！", "zh": "野性风吗……确实，这里大自然气息十足，要是摆个帅气的姿势，说不定会更有气势！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_6102_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f3bc8a3b0122f82ef7112d4954fb5e0a807e1901ff1dde4245d511d160ce0075", "ja": "ありがとう、{$P$}！\nアタシ、ワイルドでクールなヒョウになってみるよ！", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}！\n我试着当一只野性又帅气的花豹看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_6200_p", "source_sha256": "75acb06281039ecdd132b50fef48c097a19d9ee1516e43333c0c020f70390278", "ja": "この衣装は、セクシーな雰囲気もあるからな。\nこういう機会に、セクシーなところを見せてみるとか？", "zh": "这套服装也有性感的感觉嘛。要不要趁这个机会，展现一下性感的一面？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_6201_034ayu", "source_sha256": "576f98fe4b2ee2f5b53600578f83803a86c91190c98131c99c56a30c0bdafaf9", "ja": "ええっ！？　セ、セクシー！？　アタシが？\nそんな……恥ずかしいよ～！　うう……。", "zh": "诶！？色、性感！？我吗？\n那怎么行……太害羞了啦～！呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_6202_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9a8d26c601fe1e75325ea39292222f1bf5661beb3c0c9ada4991ecbe995d35f3", "ja": "でも{$P$}のいう通り、こんな機会\nじゃないと……。ちょっと考える時間ちょうだい！", "zh": "不过，正如{$P$}所说，如果不是这样的机会……\n给我一点时间考虑一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_6300_p", "source_sha256": "7ce4d8cb973581ffc05f53077fff32461e2b6028ea1bec435cbcfb4a13279e64", "ja": "それなら、飄々とした雰囲気でいくのはどうだ？\nヒョウだけにな！", "zh": "那样的话，营造出一副飘然自在的氛围怎么样？\n因为是“飘”嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_6301_034ayu", "source_sha256": "224292fb471da1a4a176cd0eed87cff4dd7b642fa673a5683c4d43b5338abbf5", "ja": "あははは、なるほどね～！\nヒョウだけに飄々と……って、ダジャレじゃん！", "zh": "啊哈哈哈，原来如此～！\n因为是豹，所以要飘飘然……等下，这不是冷笑话吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_6302_034ayu", "source_sha256": "749b84fa7f5fc1dc59a107491479c0f13000ea0f256ab34f821ad86334d148df", "ja": "しかも、飄々とした雰囲気とかよくわかんないし……。\n{$P$}、ちゃんと考えてくんない？", "zh": "而且，我也完全搞不懂什么叫飘飘然的感觉……。\n{$P$}，你能不能认真想想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
